
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Babylon AI Video</title>
<style>
body{background:#101020;color:white;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;text-align:center;padding:30px 15px}
h1{color:#a78bfa}
textarea{width:90%;height:120px;border-radius:10px;padding:10px}
button{background:#7c3aed;color:white;border:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Babylon AI Video</h1>
<p>Turn your ideas into amazing videos!</p>
<textarea placeholder="Describe the video you want to create"></textarea>
<p><button>Generate Video</button></p>
<p>Welcome to your AI video studio.</p>
</body>
</html>
